usage: runtime_control_edit_eligibility_uat.py [-h] [--workspace WORKSPACE]
                                               --candidate-root CANDIDATE_ROOT
                                               --output OUTPUT
                                               [--scope {full,extended,extended-tail,final-only}]

Bounded networkless SQL proof of governed-settings original requests. Captures
exact local prerequisites and fixtures before execution. A retained row-free
schema/ACL and synthetic financial fixtures are installed in a new, labelled
network-none target. The additive migration runs as postgres NOSUPER. No
shared database, hosted Auth, signed JWT, provider or device is exercised.

options:
